# Lift the Lid

Field guide to the built world. Voice matches quiet industrial-design writing — Super Normal, Industrial Design A–Z, Judge This first impressions. Show, don't label. No "fascinating" / "amazing".

## Story JSON schema

Identify responses must match:

```json
{
  "name": "",
  "hook": "",
  "confidence": "high|medium|low",
  "layers": [{ "layer": "", "role": "", "marvel": "" }],
  "materials": [{ "material": "", "why": "" }],
  "the_marvel": "",
  "history": "",
  "look_closer": "",
  "curiosity": [{ "label": "Inside", "question": "", "answer": "" }]
}
```

4–7 layers, outside-in, plus 3–4 curiosity threads that lead into parts, materials,
history, or something the user can inspect. Prompt lives in `lib/prompt.ts`.

## Art

Warm paper, ink, soft brass, and a quiet teal. Serif display + restrained sans. Hardware-clean industrial design sketches with a little field-note texture, not purple neon AI chrome. Compress client images to max 1280px JPEG ~0.8 before API POSTs.

## Public gallery

`/api/scans` POST: rate-limit by IP, reject `confidence: "low"`, validate story shape, `hidden` boolean for moderation. Gallery read failures return a safe 503 message instead of leaking storage or DNS errors. Share pages `/s/[id]` need Open Graph via `generateMetadata` (scan photo + object name).
